WEBVTT

01:26.630 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.539 --> 01:32.920
[Episode 9]

01:34.710 --> 01:36.789
How heartless you are.

01:38.150 --> 01:40.810
I allowed you to
settle down in the Rong Mansion,

01:41.009 --> 01:42.320
yet you never changed.

01:43.310 --> 01:45.240
You took a bribe from the He family,

01:46.920 --> 01:49.070
and almost ruined the well
while covering for him,

01:49.070 --> 01:50.070
causing trouble!

01:53.479 --> 01:55.640
Now that you've climbed to someone higher,

01:55.640 --> 01:58.440
there's no need for you
to stay in the Rong Mansion.

02:01.000 --> 02:01.680
Ms. Yan.

02:10.910 --> 02:12.370
If you dare to drive me out,

02:13.090 --> 02:15.310
by tomorrow the whole city will know that

02:15.310 --> 02:17.170
you, Head Maid of the Rong family,

02:18.460 --> 02:19.390
are licentious.

02:28.630 --> 02:30.100
What a fool.

02:31.079 --> 02:32.240
The Rong family

02:33.030 --> 02:35.430
has never been afraid
of worldly opinions.

02:36.430 --> 02:37.630
Just tell them.

02:38.800 --> 02:39.800
Let's see

02:39.800 --> 02:42.200
whether they mock me for being licentious,

02:42.800 --> 02:44.200
or laugh at you

02:45.870 --> 02:47.320
for being ungrateful.

02:48.060 --> 02:48.690
Guards!

02:52.030 --> 02:53.079
What are you doing?

02:53.079 --> 02:54.030
Drag him out.

02:54.170 --> 02:55.500
Give him eighty lashes,

02:55.870 --> 02:56.630
then drive him out of the Rong Mansion.

02:56.630 --> 02:57.079
Yes.

02:57.150 --> 02:58.880
You vicious woman! Let go of me!

02:59.010 --> 03:01.520
Let go of me! You vicious woman!

03:15.470 --> 03:17.040
Who's there? Breaking in at night!

03:17.040 --> 03:18.440
You frightened our Miss.

03:18.870 --> 03:19.550
Who are you?

03:25.850 --> 03:28.130
[Lan]

03:29.800 --> 03:30.400
It's her.

03:32.310 --> 03:33.910
Guards! Guards!

03:36.079 --> 03:37.140
Yes, Young Master.

03:38.070 --> 03:40.270
Go back to the Yang family immediately.

03:42.470 --> 03:43.030
Hurry.

03:44.390 --> 03:44.870
Yes.

03:49.110 --> 03:50.320
[Rong Mansion]

04:04.120 --> 04:05.520
Have you finished
copying The Classic of Tea?

04:05.520 --> 04:06.650
Where are you going?

04:06.710 --> 04:07.120
Yunxi.

04:07.120 --> 04:08.450
Don't tease me.

04:09.840 --> 04:10.900
Haven't you heard?

04:11.310 --> 04:12.310
That King of Tea Tree...

04:12.310 --> 04:13.240
Well, you always

04:15.120 --> 04:16.779
stir up trouble over nothing.

04:17.070 --> 04:18.800
No good comes of it, just a mess.

04:19.430 --> 04:20.120
Why does Grandmother

04:20.120 --> 04:21.250
protect her so much?

04:22.320 --> 04:23.640
Think about it.

04:25.510 --> 04:27.310
It's all because of her Tea Bone.

04:27.510 --> 04:29.170
Everyone keeps praising her.

04:30.360 --> 04:31.310
Exactly.

04:36.190 --> 04:37.390
You mean...

04:38.000 --> 04:38.600
No hurry.

04:39.560 --> 04:41.360
I'll explain it to you in detail.

04:42.240 --> 04:42.830
Cuiwei.

04:43.240 --> 04:44.950
Go invite Yune and Yunshu

04:44.950 --> 04:45.680
for tea.

04:47.000 --> 04:48.270
Rong Yunshu is fine.

04:48.600 --> 04:49.400
But Rong Yune?

04:50.430 --> 04:52.159
She's scared of her own shadow.

04:52.830 --> 04:54.040
What could she possibly do?

04:54.040 --> 04:56.120
She has a brother out there.

04:56.750 --> 04:58.240
He's not much,

04:58.720 --> 05:01.240
but sometimes he can be useful.

05:02.360 --> 05:03.220
Go invite them.

05:08.920 --> 05:09.430
Don't stop me!

05:09.430 --> 05:10.240
You can't go in.

05:10.240 --> 05:11.500
I want to see Miss Rong.

05:11.750 --> 05:12.720
Let me in!

05:13.920 --> 05:14.720
No!

05:14.720 --> 05:15.870
Just let me in!

05:17.120 --> 05:17.600
You...

05:17.600 --> 05:18.460
You can't go in.

05:19.430 --> 05:20.070
Gentlemen.

05:20.070 --> 05:21.160
Please let me in!

05:21.360 --> 05:22.310
I beg you.

05:22.310 --> 05:23.190
What happened?

05:24.630 --> 05:26.190
Miss Rong! Miss Rong!

05:26.510 --> 05:27.830
Do you remember me?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.430
I nursed you when you were little.

05:29.430 --> 05:30.690
Miss Rong! Step aside!

05:30.800 --> 05:33.000
If my life hadn't become so unbearable,

05:33.190 --> 05:35.070
I would never have dared to come to you.

05:35.070 --> 05:36.310
Miss Rong!

05:36.870 --> 05:38.040
Miss Rong!

05:38.480 --> 05:39.600
Do you know where you are?

05:39.600 --> 05:40.750
How dare you make a scene here?

05:40.750 --> 05:41.390
Leave now!

05:41.950 --> 05:43.830
I nursed Miss Rong myself.

05:44.390 --> 05:45.750
If Madam Su were still alive,

05:45.750 --> 05:47.190
would a mere maid like you

05:47.190 --> 05:48.650
even dare to argue with me?

05:49.070 --> 05:51.360
Miss Rong is not ungrateful.

05:51.830 --> 05:54.430
She would never forget
her poor wet nurse.

05:55.190 --> 05:56.680
Floods ruined my home.

05:57.240 --> 05:59.390
I've walked a thousand miles to find you.

05:59.390 --> 06:01.600
My feet are blistered and raw.

06:01.680 --> 06:04.560
Miss Rong! Miss Rong!

06:04.680 --> 06:05.870
Miss Rong!

06:06.630 --> 06:07.360
Miss Rong!

06:07.360 --> 06:08.750
This madwoman's drunk,

06:08.830 --> 06:09.630
claiming kin at random.

06:09.630 --> 06:10.560
Drag her away!

06:12.680 --> 06:13.510
Miss Rong!

06:15.950 --> 06:17.210
You greedy old beggar.

06:17.430 --> 06:18.430
We gave you money just yesterday,

06:18.430 --> 06:19.800
and today you lie and cheat again.

06:19.800 --> 06:20.390
Ms. Xu

06:20.390 --> 06:22.070
runs a thriving shop
on Feicui Street in the south.

06:22.070 --> 06:23.800
She's now the matriarch
of a provincial graduate's family,

06:23.800 --> 06:24.560
visiting and giving her regards

06:24.560 --> 06:25.800
to Old Madam Rong every year.

06:25.800 --> 06:26.630
Who are you, pretending to

06:26.630 --> 06:28.030
be Miss Rong's wet nurse?

06:29.510 --> 06:30.070
My Lady.

06:30.750 --> 06:32.550
Remember what I said yesterday?

06:32.560 --> 06:34.600
Doing good deeds doesn't always pay off.

06:34.600 --> 06:36.330
And now she's latched onto you.

06:36.560 --> 06:37.360
Take her away.

06:37.680 --> 06:39.630
If I lie, may Heaven strike me dead!

06:39.920 --> 06:40.830
I'm truly her wet nurse!

06:40.830 --> 06:42.190
karma!

06:42.830 --> 06:43.830
This crazy woman must

06:43.830 --> 06:45.240
be money-hungry

06:45.680 --> 06:46.480
to dare extort the Rong family.

06:46.480 --> 06:47.280
That's right.

06:47.430 --> 06:49.120
Bind her and turn her in
if she stirs up more trouble.

06:49.120 --> 06:50.390
Right, turn her in!

06:51.720 --> 06:53.750
We've been walking
around the garden for half a day,

06:53.750 --> 06:55.680
yet you still won't tell the truth.

06:56.270 --> 06:57.510
What's so hidden

06:57.510 --> 06:58.770
that even I can't know?

07:00.510 --> 07:01.800
It's well known in the household

07:01.800 --> 07:02.720
that Shanbao arranged a marriage

07:02.720 --> 07:04.380
at the Tea Ancestor Ceremony.

07:05.310 --> 07:06.240
Mr. Lu.

07:06.240 --> 07:07.640
You're often at her side.

07:08.120 --> 07:10.160
Have you ever heard her mention it?

07:11.190 --> 07:12.450
Are you suspecting me?

07:14.750 --> 07:16.720
Mr. Wen, you're worrying far too much.

07:16.720 --> 07:18.290
You know that I'm devoted
to repaying Miss Rong's kindness.

07:18.290 --> 07:20.000
I don't have any improper thoughts.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.750
Miss Rong is

07:20.750 --> 07:22.150
an unattainable beauty.

07:22.390 --> 07:23.830
She is pure and lofty,

07:24.270 --> 07:25.560
far beyond someone

07:25.560 --> 07:26.240
like me.

07:28.680 --> 07:29.310
But...

07:30.560 --> 07:31.120
What?

07:32.000 --> 07:33.630
Though Mr. He and Mr. Yang

07:33.630 --> 07:34.490
are out of hope,

07:34.790 --> 07:36.990
there is still Mr. Yan in the household.

07:37.920 --> 07:40.000
Though you have won Miss Rong's favor,

07:40.000 --> 07:40.720
he is the one

07:40.720 --> 07:42.180
favored by Old Madam Rong.

07:42.430 --> 07:44.360
He comes from a renowned tea family,

07:44.360 --> 07:45.430
carrying himself with grace

07:45.430 --> 07:46.490
and noble bearing.

07:46.600 --> 07:49.000
He's the perfect man
to be Miss Rong's husband.

07:49.000 --> 07:51.120
You have your own strengths.

07:51.950 --> 07:53.040
Who will prevail

07:53.800 --> 07:55.130
in the end is uncertain.

07:56.950 --> 07:57.880
Shanbao is back!

08:01.950 --> 08:02.480
Shanbao!

08:11.140 --> 08:11.610
Shanbao.

08:11.610 --> 08:12.170
Mr. Wen.

08:14.430 --> 08:15.430
When you are free,

08:15.430 --> 08:16.630
you should visit Chongxi Hall

08:16.630 --> 08:17.360
more often.

08:17.870 --> 08:19.240
After all, Old Madam Rong

08:19.240 --> 08:20.900
is the head of the Rong Family.

08:23.830 --> 08:25.230
Thanks for the reminder.

08:25.510 --> 08:27.190
I actually have a Longevity Screen

08:27.190 --> 08:29.120
that I intend to offer to Lady Rong.

08:29.310 --> 08:29.830
Thanks.

08:42.000 --> 08:43.030
Is it Fusheng?

08:43.960 --> 08:44.600
Let him in.

08:59.440 --> 09:00.500
Miss Rong said that

09:00.550 --> 09:02.350
she doesn't need you here for now.

09:02.350 --> 09:03.350
You all may leave.

09:03.720 --> 09:04.270
Yes.

09:07.980 --> 09:08.550
Let's go.

09:13.080 --> 09:13.790
A beggar?

09:17.440 --> 09:18.750
The people with me

09:19.670 --> 09:21.240
are too conspicuous to appear.

09:21.240 --> 09:22.870
You just need to keep an eye on that woman

09:22.870 --> 09:24.130
and see where she goes.

09:24.440 --> 09:25.240
And if anyone

09:25.240 --> 09:27.390
in the Rong household
meets her in private.

09:27.390 --> 09:28.990
Is she really your wet nurse?

09:30.400 --> 09:30.870
Then...

09:31.390 --> 09:33.050
Why I didn't acknowledge her?

09:35.360 --> 09:37.220
Her hometown is far off in Yuzhou.

09:37.550 --> 09:39.750
A lone woman travelled a thousand miles

09:39.750 --> 09:40.550
to seek me out,

09:40.910 --> 09:42.080
arriving at Linji precisely

09:42.080 --> 09:43.280
before the ceremony.

09:43.750 --> 09:45.670
Instead of quietly sending word
through the back gate,

09:45.670 --> 09:48.000
she confronts me before all eyes
and demands recognition.

09:48.000 --> 09:50.060
What do you think her intentions are?

09:51.870 --> 09:53.130
You really believe me?

10:01.670 --> 10:03.840
I haven't yet fulfilled
the promise I made you.

10:03.840 --> 10:05.370
If something happens to me,

10:05.450 --> 10:06.480
you will never know

10:06.480 --> 10:07.270
who you are.

10:07.910 --> 10:09.040
If I don't trust you,

10:09.120 --> 10:10.250
who else can I trust?

10:15.000 --> 10:16.600
I won't fail your trust.

10:17.750 --> 10:19.410
Then what are you waiting for?

10:43.720 --> 10:44.080
Let go!

10:44.080 --> 10:45.600
How can you stay at my inn
without any money?

10:45.600 --> 10:46.360
Keep this up,

10:46.600 --> 10:47.870
and I'll send you to authorities!

10:47.870 --> 10:48.430
You've nearly

10:48.430 --> 10:49.990
twisted my arm off.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.590
I'd love to see you send me there.

10:53.080 --> 10:53.550
I

10:53.960 --> 10:54.790
am the wet nurse

10:54.790 --> 10:56.720
of Miss Rong of the Rong household!

10:57.000 --> 10:57.840
Wet nurse?

10:58.270 --> 10:58.870
Leave now!

10:59.390 --> 10:59.670
Now!

11:01.870 --> 11:02.750
She's here just to freeload, isn't she?

11:02.750 --> 11:04.350
What's there to laugh about?

11:05.670 --> 11:06.800
She's actually mad?

11:07.080 --> 11:07.670
Right.

11:10.630 --> 11:11.630
Calm down, Ms. Bo.

11:12.270 --> 11:14.360
There's no need to bother with them.

11:16.750 --> 11:17.550
Who are you?

11:18.600 --> 11:19.750
You don't recognize me.

11:19.750 --> 11:20.750
It's a long story.

11:23.320 --> 11:24.450
Get a superior room.

11:25.790 --> 11:26.320
Okay!

11:27.330 --> 11:28.150
Ms. Bo, please.

11:28.150 --> 11:29.010
He paid for her.

11:32.550 --> 11:33.240
Please come in.

11:33.240 --> 11:34.440
How can he pay for her?

11:34.600 --> 11:35.240
Disperse!

11:35.240 --> 11:36.390
What's going on?

11:35.280 --> 11:37.260
[Ruifu Inn]

11:38.030 --> 11:39.890
Ms. Bo, you wouldn't understand.

11:39.960 --> 11:40.790
Shanbao

11:41.150 --> 11:42.410
has her own struggles.

11:43.320 --> 11:44.870
As the eldest lady of the Rong household,

11:44.870 --> 11:45.840
she may seem

11:45.840 --> 11:46.900
admired in public.

11:47.260 --> 11:48.150
Yet in private,

11:48.350 --> 11:49.700
there are plenty who envy her,

11:49.700 --> 11:50.550
longing for

11:50.550 --> 11:51.750
her downfall.

11:52.690 --> 11:54.180
Miss Rong is like a deity.

11:55.080 --> 11:56.960
Who would dare show her any disrespect?

11:56.960 --> 11:58.030
She's busy,

11:58.440 --> 11:59.240
but she hasn't

11:59.440 --> 12:00.550
forgotten you.

12:00.870 --> 12:03.030
With so many people just now,
it wasn't appropriate

12:03.030 --> 12:04.230
to acknowledge you openly.

12:04.230 --> 12:05.800
Please don't be angry.

12:07.230 --> 12:07.800
Oh.

12:08.390 --> 12:09.000
These were

12:09.600 --> 12:11.260
all sent to you at her request.

12:19.120 --> 12:20.480
This is far too much.

12:21.840 --> 12:23.270
How can I accept this?

12:26.890 --> 12:27.850
I knew it.

12:28.550 --> 12:31.150
Miss Rong has a heart of gold,

12:32.750 --> 12:35.000
and is always kind
to the poor and the weak.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.120
She may forget anyone else,

12:36.120 --> 12:38.050
but she'd never forget her family.

12:38.120 --> 12:38.850
If it weren't

12:39.600 --> 12:41.270
for my plan back then,

12:41.970 --> 12:44.030
she wouldn't be so celebrated today.

12:44.150 --> 12:45.390
She can't forget me.

12:46.120 --> 12:46.830
Never.

12:47.630 --> 12:48.790
Your plan?

12:49.380 --> 12:51.390
Ms. Bo, what do you mean?

12:53.550 --> 12:54.320
Well...

12:58.270 --> 12:59.700
I don't mind saying this.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.960
Miss Rong owes me some gratitude

13:01.960 --> 13:03.440
for raising her.

13:04.040 --> 13:05.920
Many good families in town

13:06.030 --> 13:07.960
support their wet nurses for life.

13:08.240 --> 13:08.670
That's right.

13:08.670 --> 13:11.130
Miss Rong has simply
returned the kindness.

13:13.910 --> 13:14.440
Yuan San.

13:15.240 --> 13:16.500
Go arrange a good meal.

13:17.030 --> 13:17.870
I want to treat Ms. Bo

13:17.870 --> 13:18.910
to some fine wine.

13:24.080 --> 13:24.680
Miss Rong.

13:25.000 --> 13:26.330
The ceremony is all set.

13:26.670 --> 13:27.790
I'll report to Old Madam Rong

13:27.790 --> 13:29.030
after you have a look.

13:29.870 --> 13:31.390
I don't like the plates for offering

13:31.390 --> 13:32.390
fresh tea leaves.

13:32.960 --> 13:34.020
Go to the storeroom

13:34.630 --> 13:36.150
and bring out the colorful

13:36.150 --> 13:37.010
butterfly set.

13:37.790 --> 13:38.360
Yes.

13:39.000 --> 13:40.600
Next time you face a problem,

13:40.670 --> 13:42.080
ask Ms. Yan.

13:42.960 --> 13:44.490
You don't have to come to me.

13:45.130 --> 13:45.730
Off you go.

13:51.790 --> 13:53.000
In past ceremonies,

13:53.400 --> 13:54.960
Miss Rong handled everything

13:54.960 --> 13:56.690
personally and meticulously.

13:57.870 --> 13:59.270
What happened this year?

14:04.150 --> 14:06.580
As for Tea Bone,

14:07.270 --> 14:08.390
having it

14:08.540 --> 14:10.300
can judge a tea's quality

14:10.730 --> 14:13.060
at a glance.

14:13.670 --> 14:15.360
Any new tea

14:15.870 --> 14:18.240
must be graded by the Rong family.

14:18.630 --> 14:20.710
The tea merchants from north and south,

14:20.710 --> 14:21.830
and the tea farmers

14:22.360 --> 14:23.960
take her word alone.

14:24.390 --> 14:26.670
That's a huge honor.

14:27.110 --> 14:28.990
But this talent

14:29.020 --> 14:32.710
isn't born overnight.

14:34.720 --> 14:37.880
When Miss Rong was three or five,

14:39.600 --> 14:41.790
she had nothing.

14:45.000 --> 14:46.360
Thankfully…

14:47.320 --> 14:48.270
I came up with...

14:48.670 --> 14:49.240
Ms. Bo!

14:49.270 --> 14:50.840
A good idea.

14:51.030 --> 14:51.960
What's the plan?

14:52.550 --> 14:52.910
Sit.

14:53.150 --> 14:55.150
I asked Madam Su

14:55.460 --> 14:56.340
to secretly

14:56.840 --> 14:58.390
hide Miss Rong.

14:59.040 --> 15:00.750
And day after day,

15:00.880 --> 15:04.000
year after year, carefully guide her.

15:04.320 --> 15:05.320
She nurtured

15:07.450 --> 15:10.930
that little seedling into a full bloom.

15:11.600 --> 15:12.150
Ms. Bo!

15:13.200 --> 15:14.720
Really?

15:15.790 --> 15:17.320
Is her Tea Bone really fake?

15:17.550 --> 15:18.550
It's fake!

15:19.510 --> 15:21.120
Yuan San, go get the brush and ink!

15:21.120 --> 15:21.630
Yes.

15:23.320 --> 15:24.600
I, Bo Rui,

15:24.960 --> 15:26.160
am a native of Yuzhou.

15:26.550 --> 15:27.910
I served as the wet nurse to Shanbao,

15:27.910 --> 15:30.390
the eldest legitimate daughter of the
eldest branch of the Linji Rong family.

15:30.390 --> 15:32.850
I obeyed the absolute
authority of Madam Su,

15:33.000 --> 15:34.790
and fabricated the story
of Shanbao's Tea Bone,

15:33.050 --> 15:34.910
[Confession Letter]

15:35.300 --> 15:37.430
defrauding the Rong family for years.

15:38.440 --> 15:39.960
To keep things quiet,

15:40.270 --> 15:42.460
Madam Su gave me 200 taels of silver
and let me go home.

15:42.460 --> 15:44.320
I dared not tell the authorities.

15:50.420 --> 15:51.540
Watch her closely.

15:52.000 --> 15:53.050
Nothing must go wrong

15:53.050 --> 15:53.910
before the ceremony.

15:53.910 --> 15:55.600
Don't worry, Young Master. I know.

15:55.600 --> 15:56.000
Go now.

16:07.200 --> 16:08.260
You know what to do?

16:09.600 --> 16:10.360
If I fail you,

16:10.550 --> 16:11.510
you can kill me.

16:12.670 --> 16:13.200
Go.

16:26.960 --> 16:28.490
You're always showing off.

16:29.390 --> 16:30.390
Now I have

16:30.390 --> 16:31.720
uncovered your secret.

16:32.090 --> 16:34.490
Let's see how Grandmother will punish you.

16:55.490 --> 16:56.220
Where is she?

17:00.390 --> 17:01.120
Where is she?

17:01.390 --> 17:02.390
No one has been here.

17:02.390 --> 17:03.750
I've been guarding outside the door.

17:03.750 --> 17:05.210
I wouldn't dare lie to you!

17:14.920 --> 17:16.180
You are right, My Lady.

17:16.180 --> 17:18.050
Mr. Rong was indeed abducted.

17:19.310 --> 17:21.160
That's great.

17:21.920 --> 17:22.849
What's so great?

17:23.480 --> 17:25.030
Now that you've found that woman,

17:25.030 --> 17:26.829
you should have sent her
to Chongxi Hall right away.

17:26.829 --> 17:27.440
Instead,

17:27.790 --> 17:30.310
you let someone else
handle such an important matter.

17:30.310 --> 17:31.570
As for Rong Shanchang,

17:32.030 --> 17:33.290
he's dumber than a pig!

17:33.350 --> 17:34.480
And now he's caught.

17:34.930 --> 17:36.260
All our efforts wasted!

17:38.000 --> 17:40.110
And you can still laugh?

17:40.550 --> 17:41.920
Yunxi's point is that

17:42.480 --> 17:44.310
it doesn't matter
if Rong Shanbao restrains him.

17:44.310 --> 17:46.200
We're just waiting for her to make a move.

17:46.200 --> 17:47.110
Once she does,

17:47.830 --> 17:50.030
it proves that she's hiding something.

17:52.960 --> 17:53.790
I see.

17:55.000 --> 17:56.510
Rong Shanbao has has fallen

17:56.510 --> 17:57.160
right into Yunxi's

17:57.160 --> 17:58.400
probing scheme.

17:59.160 --> 18:00.560
At tomorrow's ceremony,

18:00.680 --> 18:01.880
in front of everyone,

18:02.350 --> 18:04.110
we'll reveal the truth.

18:04.510 --> 18:06.200
Everyone should know it.

18:09.000 --> 18:10.590
Yunyin, come closer.

18:54.450 --> 19:00.960
♪ Tea Deity above, with boundless grace ♪

19:01.840 --> 19:08.000
♪ Today we bring incense,
devotion in place ♪

19:08.110 --> 19:14.610
♪ Mountains and waters
all under Thy sway ♪

19:14.640 --> 19:21.620
♪ May You abide forever,
blessings here stay ♪

19:50.960 --> 19:51.550
Shanbao.

19:54.680 --> 19:55.720
This year,

19:56.100 --> 19:58.160
you'll honor the Tea Ancestor for me.

20:07.090 --> 20:07.570
Yes.

20:22.900 --> 20:24.400
First, we honor Heaven and Earth,

20:24.400 --> 20:26.350
praying for favorable weather
throughout the year

20:26.350 --> 20:27.610
and a rich tea harvest.

20:28.750 --> 20:29.920
Second, we honor all living beings,

20:29.920 --> 20:31.780
wishing for peace across the land

20:32.180 --> 20:33.730
and smooth tea trade.

20:34.590 --> 20:35.890
Third, we honor the Tea Ancestor,

20:35.890 --> 20:37.870
blessing the livelihoods of tea farmers

20:37.870 --> 20:40.530
and the eternal prosperity
of the tea industry.

20:51.310 --> 20:53.640
I, Rong Shanbao,
eldest legitimate granddaughter

20:53.640 --> 20:56.440
of the sixteenth generation
of the Rong eldest branch,

20:56.440 --> 20:58.550
present the first fresh tea leaves
with my family,

20:58.550 --> 21:01.270
praying that the Tea Ancestor
protects the Rong family,

21:01.270 --> 21:02.510
maintains harmony across generations,

21:02.510 --> 21:03.830
ensures that we carry on
the ancestral business,

21:03.830 --> 21:05.270
and guarantees the flourishing

21:05.270 --> 21:06.470
of tea trade forever.

21:24.880 --> 21:26.210
She doesn't deserve it!

21:30.310 --> 21:31.790
What does Lady Yunxi mean?

21:33.880 --> 21:34.900
Why did she say that?

21:34.900 --> 21:35.830
What's going on?

21:37.960 --> 21:39.690
I know I disturbed the ceremony

21:39.990 --> 21:41.520
and violated family rules.

21:41.710 --> 21:43.240
I'm willing to be punished.

21:43.790 --> 21:45.390
But this is a serious matter.

21:45.750 --> 21:47.790
I fear the Tea Ancestor
would hold it against us,

21:47.790 --> 21:48.920
so I dare not hide it.

21:49.730 --> 21:50.530
Grandmother.

21:52.050 --> 21:54.070
What punishment should someone receive

21:54.070 --> 21:55.750
for pretending to have the Tea Bone

21:55.750 --> 21:57.150
and deceiving everyone?

21:57.860 --> 21:58.560
What do you mean?

21:58.560 --> 21:59.320
It's fake?

22:10.350 --> 22:11.070
Lady Yunxi.

22:11.710 --> 22:13.960
Old Madam Rong has managed
the Rong family for decades.

22:13.960 --> 22:16.240
Her eyes are sharp and discerning.

22:17.030 --> 22:18.350
Who can possibly

22:18.350 --> 22:19.680
pretend to have the Tea Bone

22:19.680 --> 22:20.590
in front of her?

22:20.750 --> 22:21.550
That's right.

22:22.000 --> 22:23.920
Do you have any proof?

22:24.640 --> 22:25.920
Today is a big day,

22:26.310 --> 22:27.920
with many honored guests present.

22:27.920 --> 22:28.750
They often turn to Miss Rong

22:28.750 --> 22:30.790
for tea identification and healing,

22:30.790 --> 22:32.390
and have benefited greatly.

22:33.160 --> 22:34.830
People remember their benefactor

22:34.830 --> 22:35.830
and are grateful.

22:36.000 --> 22:37.350
How could this be faked?

22:37.510 --> 22:38.070
Exactly.

22:38.510 --> 22:40.110
Miss Rong's ability

22:40.270 --> 22:41.070
to heal sick tea plants

22:41.070 --> 22:42.000
is known to all.

22:42.270 --> 22:44.160
Last year, when my seedlings

22:44.510 --> 22:46.270
were all black and dying,

22:46.550 --> 22:48.480
it was her expertise

22:48.550 --> 22:50.510
that saved my family.

22:51.920 --> 22:52.720
Excuse me.

22:53.310 --> 22:54.030
Why did Lady yunxi

22:54.030 --> 22:56.090
say that Lady Shanbao has no Tea Bone?

22:57.200 --> 22:58.350
The Tea Ancestor Ceremony

22:58.350 --> 22:59.680
is a major annual event.

23:00.750 --> 23:02.640
Lady yunxi knows its weight.

23:03.270 --> 23:04.600
If she dares to say that,

23:04.960 --> 23:06.290
she must have evidence.

23:07.400 --> 23:08.800
Why are you making a fuss?

23:21.960 --> 23:24.270
Old Madam Rong, I'm guilty.

23:24.680 --> 23:26.000
I deserve to die!

23:26.310 --> 23:27.550
But please spare me!

23:28.270 --> 23:28.880
You are...

23:30.200 --> 23:32.800
Grandmother, how could you
not recognize her?

23:33.530 --> 23:35.710
When Shanbao was born, she was frail

23:35.830 --> 23:37.240
and always needed medicine.

23:37.240 --> 23:37.880
A fortune teller advised

23:37.880 --> 23:40.030
finding someone with strong vitality
to keep her safe.

23:40.030 --> 23:41.400
After searching all of Linji City,

23:41.400 --> 23:42.440
you brought in her

23:43.110 --> 23:44.000
and Ms. Xu

23:44.000 --> 23:45.260
to serve in our family.

23:46.440 --> 23:48.160
Those with the Tea Bone in the Rong family

23:48.160 --> 23:49.960
have always been exceptionally gifted.

23:49.960 --> 23:51.270
By age three they can recognize tea,

23:51.270 --> 23:53.350
and by seven or eight,
they've studied all the tea classics

23:53.350 --> 23:55.110
and can cure difficult tea problems.

23:55.110 --> 23:56.750
But at that time, her ability

23:57.030 --> 23:58.430
was no different from us.

23:59.070 --> 24:00.110
Only after going with Mother

24:00.110 --> 24:01.710
to Mount Putuo to recuperate

24:02.440 --> 24:04.200
did she suddenly show her talent,

24:04.200 --> 24:06.240
curing all the diseased tea

24:06.240 --> 24:08.110
that even the best
tea masters couldn't save,

24:08.110 --> 24:10.110
creating a sensation in Linji City.

24:11.160 --> 24:13.020
The Rong family has had countless

24:13.400 --> 24:15.070
tea geniuses over sixteen generations.

24:15.070 --> 24:16.030
Some show talent early,

24:16.030 --> 24:17.030
some late.

24:17.070 --> 24:18.220
What's the big deal?

24:29.840 --> 24:31.970
Go ahead, Ms. Bo.

24:37.100 --> 24:37.960
Old Madam Rong,

24:38.400 --> 24:41.400
you have always held high hopes
for the eldest branch.

24:41.490 --> 24:44.690
Seeing that Lady Shanbao's
natural talent was mediocre,

24:44.720 --> 24:46.180
Madam Su worried she might

24:46.310 --> 24:47.550
lose favor over time.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.090
So she took Lady Shanbao to apprentice

24:49.090 --> 24:51.150
under Elder Shenghui at Mount Putuo.

24:51.590 --> 24:54.830
The master had studied
herbs since childhood.

24:55.350 --> 24:57.680
Although he was not born
with the Tea Bone,

24:57.730 --> 24:59.580
he had a keen eye for tea.

25:00.480 --> 25:02.340
Under the guise of recuperation,

25:02.700 --> 25:03.490
Lady Shanbao studied

25:03.490 --> 25:05.120
with him day and night,

25:05.140 --> 25:06.470
learning to identify and cure tea.

25:06.470 --> 25:08.150
With Madam Su's careful guidance,

25:08.150 --> 25:09.610
who is well-versed in tea,

25:09.720 --> 25:10.580
she eventually

25:12.160 --> 25:14.160
even fooled the Old Madam Rong.

25:15.220 --> 25:16.880
Does Lady Shanbao not have the Tea Bone?

25:16.880 --> 25:17.610
Impossible.

25:18.070 --> 25:20.240
Lady Shanbao doesn't have the Tea Bone?

25:20.240 --> 25:21.090
Let go of me!

25:21.400 --> 25:22.330
How dare you lie

25:22.360 --> 25:23.820
and slander Lady Shanbao!

25:24.030 --> 25:24.990
Let go of me!

25:27.720 --> 25:28.480
Let go of me!

25:30.510 --> 25:31.710
And who might this be?

25:36.210 --> 25:38.110
Shanchang, where have you been?

25:38.680 --> 25:40.070
Grandmother was looking for you
all over just now

25:40.070 --> 25:41.600
and nearly lost her temper.

25:41.720 --> 25:42.980
Grandmother, help me!

25:43.750 --> 25:45.210
He works for Rong Shanbao.

25:45.400 --> 25:47.030
Fearing their scheme would fail,

25:47.030 --> 25:48.510
they teamed up to abduct your grandson!

25:48.510 --> 25:50.210
What nonsense are you talking about?

25:50.210 --> 25:51.320
Why would Miss Rong

25:51.480 --> 25:52.550
kidnap you without any reason?

25:52.550 --> 25:53.480
Because I discovered

25:53.480 --> 25:54.960
she doesn't have the Tea Bone.

25:54.960 --> 25:56.240
She feared I'd present
the confession letter

25:56.240 --> 25:57.880
to Grandmother and expose her,

25:57.880 --> 25:59.200
so she kidnapped me

25:59.350 --> 26:00.680
when I let my guard down.

26:06.160 --> 26:06.670
Right.

26:07.720 --> 26:08.670
The confession letter!

26:08.670 --> 26:09.990
Is this what you said?

26:19.150 --> 26:19.870
Mr. Yang.

26:32.960 --> 26:34.220
It doesn't make sense.

26:35.450 --> 26:37.310
If Lady Shanbao could kidnap you,

26:37.640 --> 26:38.240
why would she spare Ms. Bo,

26:38.240 --> 26:39.750
the real culprit?

26:40.670 --> 26:42.300
If she'd taken Ms. Bo as well,

26:43.410 --> 26:45.340
there wouldn't be this mess today.

26:48.200 --> 26:50.640
That day, I sensed something was wrong

26:51.400 --> 26:52.800
and feared I'd be killed,

26:53.240 --> 26:53.880
so I fled through

26:53.880 --> 26:55.740
the back window, risking my life.

26:56.960 --> 26:57.640
Mr. Rong.

26:58.590 --> 27:00.930
The confession letter
is in your handwriting.

27:00.930 --> 27:01.750
So you are also one of those

27:01.750 --> 27:03.480
who incited Madam Bo to falsely

27:03.480 --> 27:04.680
accuse Lady Shanbao.

27:05.640 --> 27:06.440
Grandmother.

27:06.640 --> 27:08.370
Don't listen to their excuses.

27:08.640 --> 27:10.440
Though the old monk passed away,

27:10.640 --> 27:11.240
there are still people

27:11.240 --> 27:13.070
on Mount Putuo who know the truth.

27:13.070 --> 27:13.870
If that fails,

27:14.160 --> 27:15.000
send someone to seize

27:15.000 --> 27:16.790
every maid and servant
previously dismissed

27:16.790 --> 27:18.390
by Madam Su for questioning.

27:18.510 --> 27:19.590
Unless she's killed

27:19.590 --> 27:20.850
every former servant,

27:21.050 --> 27:23.530
the truth will eventually come to light.

27:26.960 --> 27:27.510
Okay.

27:28.160 --> 27:29.290
Well, I have someone

27:29.670 --> 27:31.200
I'd like you to meet as well.

27:44.300 --> 27:45.160
Old Madam Rong.

27:45.920 --> 27:46.830
This is a temple attendant

27:46.830 --> 27:48.160
from Fengqiu County, Yuzhou.

27:48.160 --> 27:49.750
He came to Linji to seek out relatives

27:49.750 --> 27:51.680
and happened to travel with Ms. Bo.

27:52.000 --> 27:53.200
I am Wang Jing.

27:53.480 --> 27:54.740
Greetings, Lady Rong.

27:55.200 --> 27:57.160
We were neighbors.

27:57.680 --> 27:59.480
I gave her a ride along the way.

28:00.180 --> 28:02.180
On the way, she drank, gambled,

28:02.480 --> 28:03.880
and used up all her money.

28:04.110 --> 28:05.960
Out of pity,

28:06.550 --> 28:08.350
I often gave her my flatbread.

28:08.860 --> 28:11.340
But once we reached Yuhang,

28:11.670 --> 28:13.130
she suddenly became rich.

28:13.790 --> 28:15.240
She paid off her old debts

28:15.680 --> 28:17.790
and even bragged that

28:18.200 --> 28:19.770
once she reached Linji,

28:20.310 --> 28:22.000
she'd have money not just for gambling,

28:22.000 --> 28:25.110
but thousands to spare.

28:26.530 --> 28:27.530
So it seems

28:28.070 --> 28:28.920
someone led her

28:28.920 --> 28:30.310
all the way to Linji,

28:30.830 --> 28:32.760
trying to deceive the Rong family.

28:33.200 --> 28:34.550
Who was behind it

28:34.960 --> 28:35.750
depends on

28:35.750 --> 28:37.010
who colluded with her.

28:37.350 --> 28:38.720
Earlier at the gate,

28:39.110 --> 28:40.200
Rong Shanbao refused to acknowledge her,

28:40.200 --> 28:41.270
so I took her away.

28:41.490 --> 28:42.490
Who do you think colluded with her?

28:42.490 --> 28:43.550
Who?

28:43.790 --> 28:44.590
Who saw it?

28:45.320 --> 28:47.160
You're lying! I don't know you!

28:47.180 --> 28:47.590
You...

28:47.620 --> 28:48.860
How can you deny it?

28:48.990 --> 28:50.720
Your debt of two taels of silver

28:50.880 --> 28:52.340
is still documented here!

28:52.480 --> 28:52.880
You...

28:53.640 --> 28:54.610
You're being shameless!

28:54.610 --> 28:55.680
How dare you!

29:02.480 --> 29:03.510
As you can see.

29:04.000 --> 29:05.200
She's a shameless gambler,

29:05.200 --> 29:06.880
swearing oaths left and right.

29:06.880 --> 29:08.030
Yet turned hostile over a mere

29:08.030 --> 29:09.630
two taels of silver just now.

29:09.680 --> 29:11.280
Can you trust a word she says?

29:12.240 --> 29:13.840
Grandmother! Grandmother!

29:14.160 --> 29:14.750
Grandmother!

29:14.750 --> 29:15.940
I really don't know the truth.

29:15.940 --> 29:17.210
I really don't know

29:17.240 --> 29:18.050
who led her here.

29:18.050 --> 29:18.930
As for that confession letter,

29:18.930 --> 29:20.960
I only got it after getting her drunk.

29:20.960 --> 29:22.310
I really don't know anything.

29:22.310 --> 29:22.790
I was drunk too!

29:22.790 --> 29:23.850
You useless thing!

29:24.860 --> 29:25.520
Lady Yunxi.

29:25.840 --> 29:27.640
All your flowery words come down

29:27.710 --> 29:29.360
to wanting to be the heir.

29:29.990 --> 29:30.990
For your own gain,

29:31.010 --> 29:32.510
you've ruined the Tea Ancestor Ceremony.

29:32.510 --> 29:33.160
How can you ignore

29:33.160 --> 29:34.360
Grandmother's hopes

29:34.590 --> 29:37.190
and the tea farmers
who have prayed for so long?

29:37.750 --> 29:39.920
Before the ancestors of the Rong family

29:39.920 --> 29:41.400
and all these guests,

29:42.110 --> 29:43.910
do you deserve to be a Rong at all?

29:44.050 --> 29:45.460
Believe it or not,

29:45.880 --> 29:47.510
I chose to expose her today

29:47.840 --> 29:50.550
only to prevent Grandmother
from being deceived.

29:50.550 --> 29:51.480
As for proof,

29:52.230 --> 29:54.090
there's already one in the house.

29:54.290 --> 29:56.190
But I don't want

29:56.220 --> 29:57.700
to embarrass Shanbao.

29:58.150 --> 29:59.550
So why make it hard for me?

30:01.540 --> 30:03.170
Yunxi is kind-hearted

30:03.830 --> 30:05.690
and always leaves room for mercy.

30:06.310 --> 30:07.390
Listen carefully.

30:07.720 --> 30:09.420
There is indeed someone in
the eldest branch with the Tea Bone.

30:09.420 --> 30:11.340
She is none other

30:12.000 --> 30:13.260
than my little sister;

30:13.350 --> 30:14.160
Rong Yunwan.

30:34.960 --> 30:36.960
Why can't you tell right from wrong?

30:37.680 --> 30:38.750
If Aunt were alive,

30:39.060 --> 30:40.320
seeing you like this,

30:41.130 --> 30:42.270
how heartbroken she would be!

30:42.270 --> 30:43.960
You don't have to feel sorry for her.

30:43.960 --> 30:46.090
Mother only cared about Rong Shanbao.

30:46.350 --> 30:47.480
She even ruined her health

30:47.480 --> 30:49.080
giving birth to Rong Yunwan.

30:49.450 --> 30:51.180
She didn't care about me at all.

30:54.800 --> 30:56.130
Bring Lady Yunwan here.

31:01.400 --> 31:02.230
Shanbao!

31:07.270 --> 31:08.000
Lady Yunwan?

31:08.550 --> 31:09.410
The Rong family

31:09.640 --> 31:10.640
has a Lady Yunwan?

31:11.060 --> 31:11.790
Exactly.

31:12.170 --> 31:13.770
We've never seen her before.

31:14.160 --> 31:15.880
Look at her, she's shifty,

31:15.900 --> 31:17.100
timid, and cowardly.

31:17.180 --> 31:19.040
There's no trace of a proper lady.

31:19.160 --> 31:20.590
It's so laughable.

31:25.830 --> 31:27.160
Shanbao, I'm so scared.

31:27.590 --> 31:29.160
They are all bad guys.

31:30.300 --> 31:31.700
Don't be afraid, Wanwan.

31:31.880 --> 31:32.880
All those present

31:32.970 --> 31:35.160
are elders and relatives
of our Rong family.

31:35.160 --> 31:36.620
They'll only care for you,

31:37.160 --> 31:38.030
not harm you.

31:50.210 --> 31:52.100
Lady Yunwan was born slow-witted

31:52.500 --> 31:53.300
and ignorant.

31:53.700 --> 31:55.560
She can't tell seasons or grains,

31:55.730 --> 31:56.720
and even needs help

31:56.720 --> 31:57.920
eating and dressing.

31:58.080 --> 31:59.940
And you think she has the Tea Bone?

32:01.240 --> 32:02.640
Send Lady Yunwan back.

32:03.440 --> 32:04.240
Grandmother.

32:04.800 --> 32:06.440
They even brought Wanwan here.

32:06.440 --> 32:07.640
If we don't verify it,

32:08.070 --> 32:09.600
how would they ever give up?

32:10.240 --> 32:12.510
For the long-term peace
of our Rong family,

32:12.510 --> 32:13.480
let them check.

32:14.110 --> 32:14.910
Shanbao.

32:15.110 --> 32:16.710
I'm not being willful this time.

32:16.710 --> 32:17.910
I just want the truth.

32:18.320 --> 32:19.350
I've seen personally

32:19.350 --> 32:20.590
that Wanwan pick out the finest tea

32:20.590 --> 32:21.720
from several kinds.

32:22.030 --> 32:23.200
Can a naturally foolish child

32:23.200 --> 32:23.880
do that?

32:24.330 --> 32:25.200
I've long suspected

32:25.200 --> 32:26.330
she has the Tea Bone.

32:30.460 --> 32:31.060
Come here!

32:32.670 --> 32:33.600
Don't scare her!

32:34.440 --> 32:35.360
Scaring her

32:35.680 --> 32:37.010
is still better than you

32:37.400 --> 32:37.960
keeping her locked in that courtyard

32:37.960 --> 32:39.940
her whole life just
to become the Tea Bone.

32:39.940 --> 32:40.340
Do it.

32:40.550 --> 32:41.680
Wanwan, do it.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.680
I saw it with my own eyes.

32:44.090 --> 32:45.550
It's not a big deal for you.

32:45.750 --> 32:47.790
Wanwan, show them.

32:48.110 --> 32:49.160
Let them see it.

32:49.650 --> 32:51.450
You're the one with the Tea Bone!

32:51.920 --> 32:52.480
And she,

32:53.200 --> 32:54.310
she doesn't have it.

32:54.310 --> 32:55.200
She's a fake!

32:55.550 --> 32:56.110
She took away

32:56.110 --> 32:57.350
your glory.

33:15.160 --> 33:15.960
Lady Shanbao.

33:16.850 --> 33:17.960
She's sharp-tongued

33:17.960 --> 33:18.890
and aggressive,

33:19.350 --> 33:20.480
clearly driven by ulterior motives

33:20.480 --> 33:21.410
to throw you off.

33:22.110 --> 33:23.240
If you don't want the test,

33:23.240 --> 33:24.040
I promise that

33:24.500 --> 33:25.660
no one can force you.

33:31.760 --> 33:32.370
Wanwan.

33:33.350 --> 33:34.950
Everyone is waiting for you.

33:35.590 --> 33:36.240
Just do it.

33:38.070 --> 33:39.600
Yunwan, do it.

33:40.620 --> 33:42.230
Hurry up! Do it!

33:42.720 --> 33:43.340
Do it!

33:44.120 --> 33:44.990
Do it now!

33:45.750 --> 33:48.440
Hurry up! Do it!

33:54.790 --> 33:55.720
Hurry up!

34:20.960 --> 34:22.320
Stop crying!

34:22.590 --> 34:24.150
You killed your own mother!

34:24.440 --> 34:26.440
I've been ruined taking care of you.

34:26.480 --> 34:28.230
Stop crying!

34:29.510 --> 34:30.320
Stop crying!

34:31.020 --> 34:31.750
Stop crying!

34:37.280 --> 34:39.139
What are you doing? Are you crazy?

34:39.550 --> 34:40.670
Are you crazy?

34:41.150 --> 34:41.719
Let go!

34:49.770 --> 34:50.600
Let go of me!

34:53.000 --> 34:53.880
Let go of me!

34:54.550 --> 34:55.480
You crazy jerk!

34:56.800 --> 34:58.030
Bad guy!

34:58.300 --> 34:59.300
I'm gonna hit you!

35:11.230 --> 35:12.030
Are you crazy?

35:12.510 --> 35:14.350
You deserve to be locked up forever!

35:14.350 --> 35:15.080
Lady Yunyin.

35:15.960 --> 35:17.290
Lady Yunwan is like a child.

35:17.290 --> 35:18.250
She was scared

35:18.280 --> 35:19.140
by your threat.

35:19.460 --> 35:20.860
You shouldn't blame her.

35:31.150 --> 35:33.410
Grandmother, whether I have the Tea Bone

35:33.480 --> 35:34.710
or become the heir

35:34.930 --> 35:35.990
means little to me.

35:36.740 --> 35:37.940
Everything I've done

35:38.840 --> 35:40.240
is for the family's honor

35:40.550 --> 35:42.350
and the prosperity of tea trade.

35:42.550 --> 35:43.880
But I won't allow anyone

35:44.070 --> 35:45.400
to hurt Wanwan.

35:46.560 --> 35:48.160
Whoever dares do this again,

35:48.590 --> 35:50.320
I will show no mercy, kin or not.

35:50.770 --> 35:51.340
What?

35:53.180 --> 35:54.710
Haven't there been

35:54.710 --> 35:55.840
enough jokes today?

35:56.310 --> 35:58.150
Are you going to let me down too?

36:17.150 --> 36:18.480
The truth of the Tea Bone

36:18.920 --> 36:20.580
concerns countless tea folk.

36:20.950 --> 36:23.150
It's never been just our
Rong family's affair.

36:23.150 --> 36:24.760
If you wish to stay

36:25.190 --> 36:26.720
as witnesses, that's fine.

36:27.030 --> 36:29.090
Now the truth has now been made clear.

36:30.280 --> 36:31.000
Next,

36:32.360 --> 36:33.280
we are going to deal with

36:33.280 --> 36:35.480
the internal matter of our Rong family.

36:35.670 --> 36:37.870
Please proceed to the main hall for tea.

36:37.960 --> 36:39.510
Everyone, this way please.

36:58.510 --> 37:00.630
Shanbao, I'll stay with you.

37:01.590 --> 37:02.320
Mr. Wen.

37:03.400 --> 37:04.510
Didn't you hear Old Madam Rong

37:04.510 --> 37:06.110
say this is family business?

37:06.480 --> 37:09.140
You're not even part
of the Rong family, are you?

37:17.480 --> 37:18.010
Let's go.

37:18.840 --> 37:19.840
This way, please.

37:33.440 --> 37:34.240
Grandmother.

37:50.550 --> 37:51.350
Grandmother.

37:52.880 --> 37:54.190
What did I do wrong?

37:55.080 --> 37:56.480
Because you are selfish.

37:57.100 --> 37:58.850
Everyone is selfish.

38:00.030 --> 38:01.000
But I dare to swear

38:01.000 --> 38:02.930
to the ancestors of the Rong family

38:03.230 --> 38:04.280
that in exposing this matter,

38:04.280 --> 38:05.610
I have no personal gain!

38:05.960 --> 38:07.030
It's all for our Rong family,

38:07.030 --> 38:08.490
and for you, Grandmother.

38:09.670 --> 38:11.840
Can Rong Shanbao swear to Heaven

38:12.590 --> 38:14.920
that she really has the Tea Bone?

38:16.820 --> 38:17.860
Our ancestors

38:17.880 --> 38:19.590
took turns to be the regent.

38:20.150 --> 38:21.150
But you, Grandmother,

38:21.150 --> 38:23.080
have entrusted everything to her.

38:23.320 --> 38:24.480
If you hadn't been unfair

38:24.480 --> 38:25.280
and biased,

38:26.190 --> 38:27.440
we wouldn't have exposed this

38:27.440 --> 38:28.370
at the ceremony.

38:36.500 --> 38:37.960
Do you think so too?

38:42.520 --> 38:44.110
Grandmother, it hurts!

38:44.590 --> 38:46.920
All these years, the Rong family

38:46.920 --> 38:48.050
has spared no effort

38:48.150 --> 38:50.240
on your upbringing and education.

38:52.920 --> 38:55.050
-Don't look.
-It hurts, Grandmother!

38:55.070 --> 38:57.150
-Grandmother!
-I told you to learn to do business.

38:57.150 --> 38:58.760
and every time you lose money.

38:58.760 --> 39:00.960
Your gambling debts
run into the thousands.

39:00.960 --> 39:02.480
What kind of curse have we met

39:02.480 --> 39:03.940
to end up with a fool like you,

39:03.940 --> 39:05.200
destroying the family

39:05.370 --> 39:06.560
and ruining

39:06.960 --> 39:07.770
our business?

39:10.920 --> 39:11.700
Grandmother!

39:11.700 --> 39:13.630
If I had known you were this rotten,

39:14.110 --> 39:16.040
dragging our family's reputation

39:16.280 --> 39:17.800
with no regard for the family at all,

39:17.800 --> 39:20.460
I would have cut ties
and thrown you out long ago.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.610
From now on,

39:23.360 --> 39:24.230
get yourself to the estate

39:24.230 --> 39:25.490
and work off your sins.

39:26.550 --> 39:27.810
Until I say otherwise,

39:28.210 --> 39:30.270
you'll be locked up in there forever!

39:40.110 --> 39:41.910
You'd better ask yourself more.

39:41.960 --> 39:44.290
Have you brought honor to the Rong family,

39:44.400 --> 39:45.890
or have you disgraced our ancestors

39:45.890 --> 39:48.320
and shamed us all?

39:49.090 --> 39:49.680
Today

39:49.830 --> 39:52.430
is the grand day of the
Tea Ancestors Ceremony.

39:52.800 --> 39:54.330
Don't let this little thing

39:54.440 --> 39:55.240
get in the way.

39:56.150 --> 39:58.510
Go back to your rooms,
get yourselves ready,

39:58.510 --> 40:00.640
and then perform the ceremony with me.

40:01.530 --> 40:02.090
Yes.

40:32.230 --> 40:33.560
Old Madam Rong said that

40:33.800 --> 40:35.060
you can go to the garden

40:35.110 --> 40:36.510
in half an hour.

40:37.480 --> 40:38.280
So,

40:38.880 --> 40:40.440
the ceremony goes on?

40:41.200 --> 40:42.280
Lady Rong said that

40:43.970 --> 40:45.900
everything will proceed as usual.

40:51.350 --> 40:52.810
Truly worthy of Lady Rong.

40:57.600 --> 40:58.770
Where is Mr. Lu?

40:59.940 --> 41:01.070
He was here just now.

41:37.440 --> 41:38.700
How dare you come here?

41:43.000 --> 41:43.640
Get lost!

41:46.960 --> 41:47.510
Yunxi

41:47.510 --> 41:49.370
has treated you so well all along,

41:49.480 --> 41:52.320
and when it really counted,
you forgot everything.

41:52.320 --> 41:53.150
You didn't say a single word

41:53.150 --> 41:54.550
at that critical moment.

41:54.590 --> 41:57.120
Have you been afraid
of getting into trouble?

41:58.190 --> 41:58.710
Yunshu.

41:59.510 --> 42:01.000
Yunyin's complaint is about

42:01.000 --> 42:02.430
Rong Shanchang being useless,

42:02.430 --> 42:03.760
not meant to blame you.

42:04.630 --> 42:05.800
Be magnanimous

42:06.360 --> 42:08.890
and forgive her
for speaking thoughtlessly.

42:10.030 --> 42:11.830
I wouldn't dare be angry, Yunxi.

42:15.550 --> 42:16.110
My Lady!

42:18.310 --> 42:19.920
You look obedient

42:20.160 --> 42:20.930
and clever,

42:21.630 --> 42:22.880
but you're really two-faced,

42:22.880 --> 42:24.410
trying to please everyone.

42:24.440 --> 42:25.710
I have always

42:26.280 --> 42:27.630
detested hypocrisy.

42:28.760 --> 42:30.730
Maybe it was you who let the this slip.

42:30.730 --> 42:31.260
Get lost!

42:37.140 --> 42:38.690
You know she's pitiful.

42:39.400 --> 42:40.510
Why did you do that?

43:24.920 --> 43:27.700
Just now, Lady Yunwan...
